Not sure why you believe you shouldn't do.
Are you planning to not allow a) binary-search based subsets, 2) joins on data.tables and 3) faster aggregation due to grouping values being in contiguous memory locations <http://stackoverflow.com/a/21175393/559784>?

Arun
From: Hadley Wickham Hadley Wickham
Reply: Hadley Wickham h.wi...@gmail.com
Date: January 20, 2014 at 7:55:01 PM
To: Arun arago...@gmail.com
Subject:  Re: dplyr and memory

